CHANGE 3246062 MERGED 2021-10-27 17:24:44.000000000 56b5de86336fc0fd0c8dbf491300763d817bb4d5 
llvm-libunwind: Change creation of libgcc_s

Instead of creating libunwind.so and pointing libgcc_s.so.1 to it
as a symlink, do the reverse i.e. libgcc_s.so.1 is the physical
file. This fixes the NaCl breakage in crbug.com/1261660.

